ut at minimum","notes":null},{"title":"Self-Exclusion","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Operator must offer players the option to self-exclude themselves for a duration of at least 1 year","notes":null},{"title":"Deposit Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Players must be able to set limits on the total amount they deposit","notes":null},{"title":"Training and Staff Readiness","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Operators must train customer service and Responsible Gaming staff to handle player interaction profesionally and effectively","notes":null},{"title":"Consumer Advertising and Marketing","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Operators must not engage in irresponsible advertising","notes":null},{"title":"Internet Filtering Tools","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Low","due":"2026-05-14","description":"The operator is advised to remind adults that they should take precautions when sharing devices with minors","notes":null},{"title":"Notifications for concerning behaviours","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Operators may employ automatic or manual pop-up notifications in response to concerning behaviours","notes":null},{"title":"Initiating direct contact","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"When a player exhibits behaviour that reasonably suggests they may be a Vulnerable Player, the operator must initiate direct contact","notes":null},{"title":"Other Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Other limits may be considered including loss limits, time limits or wager limits, in line wth the operator's target player and/or market","notes":null}]}]}]}